# cw017, the lake swimmer (doc 84 §7.9). Test fixture: written for the talk town's Coldwater keeper; every item kind.
mantle cw017
state ready
dialect coldwater
accent broad light
tier full
written_for tt_co_keeper
title the lake swimmer
fits stage=adult|old
prefers role=merchant warmth=warm
traits temper=calm talk=plain warmth=warm humour=none piety=ordinary drive=content
quirk swims_in_the_lake_even_in_autumn
likes still_water cold_mornings smoked_eel
dislikes hurry wet_floors
fears deep_winter_ice
hopes a_quiet_old_age
topics weather +.4 lore +.3 prices -.3
styles tease=none refuse=soft comfort=practical gossip=reluctant
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# keeps the stores by the lake: calm, warm and plain, and swims every morning till the ice says no.

words
oath! = Deep and dark | Glass and stone
saying! = The lake keeps its own accounts | Still water settles every argument
swim = every morning till the ice | before the boats, every day
brisk = cold enough to wake the dead | sharp as a gutting knife

opinion road against 2 : The High Road? I'd not send my own soap up it.
opinion road against 2 [conv.agreed_before=no] : The High Road again? You know where I stand.
opinion watch mixed 1 : The Watch walk the lanes like the cobbles bite them. But they do walk them.

grown
line tell.self [concept=talk.day here.time=dawn|day] : {did=swim} Had my swim before I took the shutters down. #brisk.capitalize#, and glad of it.
line insist [conv.did=swim] : Every year since I was a minnow, and the lake hasn't had me yet. #oath#.
line @carry request [concept=talk.work other.job=carter] : {request=carry} Will you take a box of my candles up the road with you?
line accept_decline : Next run, then. I'll not have you holed for a box of candles.
line preclose [self.working=yes] : Well. The counter won't mind itself.
line farewell : #farewell#. Mind the step, it's slick.
line react.news.new : #oath#! And me stood here pricing string.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line greet.return [self.working=yes] : #greet#. Come in out of the wind.

story first_swim [concept=talk.memories]
  : #mum.capitalize# threw me off the jetty when I was a minnow. Said the lake teaches what she can't.
  : I've gone in #swim# since.
  ask : Do you swim yourself?
  b[old] : Not since my knees went.
  b : Not if I can help it.

scene shutters
when concept=talk.weather here.time=dawn|day
does tell.self / react.self
a : The lake's like glass this morning. I'll be in it before the shutters are down.
b : You'll catch your death one of these mornings.

dlg shop.greet : #greet#. Salt, candles, string, soap. If the lake doesn't sell it, I do.
dlg shop.greet [topic.meeting=known] : #greet#, #topic.player#. In out of the wet. Looking or buying?
dlg resident.hub [here.outdoors=fog] : #greet#. Come in out of the mist; the floor's wet, mind. What's wanted?
dlg resident.bye : #farewell#. Mind the step; it's slick.

graft resident.hub
choice You swim in the lake? In this weather? [here.season=spring|autumn|winter] -> swim
node swim
say Every morning till the ice says no. It clears the head. You should try it.
mood pleased
free
choice Not for all the coin in the realm. -> hub
choice Where do you go in? -> swim_where
node swim_where
say Off the end of the jetty, before the boats go out. Come at dawn and I'll show you, if you've the fur for it.
invite jetty dawn 3d
choice I might, at that. -> hub
choice Goodbye. -> bye

young
line tell.boast : I swam out to the second post! Don't tell #mum#.
